<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean and products basis levels.</p>
<p>(NB - no buyer T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	BASIS	 MONTH	   PREV</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> March	   3/7  P	March	   2/7</p>
<p> April	   3/4	   April	   N/A</p>
<p> May	     1/4  P	May	   5 D/3  P</p>
<p> July	    2/even P    July	  5 D/3  P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS     MONTH	  PREV</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> January	    7/10 P   January	10/13 P</p>
<p> March	     12/10 D   March	  12/8  D</p>
<p> May		 16/14.5 D May	    20/15 D</p>
<p> July		19/17 D   July	   21/13 D</p>
<p> SHIPMENT    BASIS	 MONTH	PREV</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> January	 30/10 D    January   30/10 D</p>
<p> March	   90/30 D    March     90/30 D</p>
<p> May	    110/80 D    May	110/80 D</p>
